# All-atom climbing NEB for partial emission at fixed applied strain (Sigma11 bicrystal).
units metal
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map array
read_data ${initial}
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ${pot} Cu
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
variable replica equal part
timestep 0.001
min_style fire
fix path all neb 1.0
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step pe fmax fnorm
neb 0.0 0.05 3000 4000 100 final ${finalcoords} verbosity verbose
write_dump all custom ${outdir}/final.${replica}.dump id type x y z modify sort id
